- What metrics would you use to determine rollback triggers during regional rollout?
- How do you balance model accuracy against size constraints for on-device deployment?
- What compliance frameworks should be considered for voice data processing?

## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical CBA for a local-first search feature, balancing storage, CPU, and privacy.

## Key Concepts
- On-device indexing
- Delta sync costs
- Privacy/compliance
- Update cadence and go/no-go criteria

## Code Example
```javascript
function indexRepo(files) {
  // naive tokenization
  const index = {};
  for (const f of files) {
    const tokens = f.content.split(/\\W+/).filter(Boolean);
    tokens.forEach(t => (index[t] ||= []).push(f.path));
  }
  return index;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you measure user time saved and energy impact to validate the break-even?
- How would you design for monorepos and very large repos with incremental indexing?

## Why This Is Asked
